# The hone counters are the Equipment's, not the creature's (CR 122.1j): Paradise Mantle, with the hone counter Dwalin's entering
# put on it, is equipped to Dwalin (3/1); Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Dwalin on turn 6, the Mantle stays on the battlefield unattached
# (CR 704.5n) with its counter, and equipped to Ornithopter on turn 7 it makes Ornithopter 1/2.

